		Text: Pages and breaks
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Keep together
		Paragraph: With `Keep together: true`, a box is not split across pages if it fits whole on the next one. The signature block below would be split at the end of page 1, so it moves to page 2 in one piece.
